[{"title":"宿红心驿","author":"陈琏","text":"民舍临官道，庭槐荫驿厅。\n山光当户翠，草色入帘青。\n为客瞻乡月，何人识使星。\n君亲常在念，终夜梦魂醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49690,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"固镇驿","author":"陈琏","text":"连朝风雨作，潦水到前厅。\n篆壁蜗留壳，穿帘鹤堕翎。\n蕃僧频入贡，使节每充庭。\n我笑驱驰惯，三年两此经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49691,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试院夜坐偶成柬同考诸公二首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"较艺欣同事，诸公总老成。\n妍媸归藻鉴，去取在权衡。\n夜静风声肃，秋深露气清。\n程文须点检，兀坐到三更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49692,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试院夜坐偶成柬同考诸公二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"北京开贡院，近在辟雍西。\n夜坐崇文阁，时分淡墨题。\n嫩凉生白纻，暖焰照青藜。\n喜遇承平世，文光映璧奎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49693,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵岩寺","author":"陈琏","text":"因访灵岩寺，羊肠山径遥。\n云峰攒玉笋，霜叶染红绡。\n希有存孤塔，崇兴见古桥。\n老僧三五辈，谁解学参寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49694,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滕县二首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"昨日方离兖，今朝又至滕。\n驿庭频遇客，寺舍少逢僧。\n树老红成阵，山多翠作层。\n城楼足清趣，何日许重登。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49695,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滕县二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"滕阳虽小邑，山水惬幽寻。\n京国三千里，庭闱一寸心。\n宾鸿来个个，官马去骎骎。\n明发邾成道，云边是孟林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49696,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿凤阳郡庠张留守诸公来访","author":"陈琏","text":"礼乐新黉舍，规模旧辟雍。\n杏坛消酷署，芹泮起清风。\n谈笑多群彦，相过有钜公。\n由来文物地，邂逅意从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49697,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过良乡望房山","author":"陈琏","text":"咫尺房山县，峰峦千万重。\n鸟飞青嶂外，人住白云中。\n俗美因时泰，秋登喜岁丰。\n金家陵尚在，烟树翠濛濛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49698,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登王陵台望泰山","author":"陈琏","text":"晓上台高处，遥看岱岳尊。\n霞光明日观，云气起天门。\n汉刻今何在，唐镵喜尚存。\n忆曾纵登览，胜事颇能论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49699,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"房村驿","author":"陈琏","text":"馆舍最清幽，沙头暂舣舟。\n鸟归烟外树，人上水边楼。\n白浪长淮雨，黄花九月秋。\n醉来歌慷慨，此地惯曾游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49700,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源","author":"陈琏","text":"薄暮至桃源，西山景渐昏。\n鹭依沙嘴静，人语渡头喧。\n日影初沉海，樵歌稍出村。\n客中无限兴，此际向谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49701,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮阴驿","author":"陈琏","text":"晚泊淮阴驿，瀼瀼白露零。\n连城闻夜柝，隔岸见秋灯。\n月落林光黑，风来水气腥。\n追思旧游地，当日有三亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49702,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兴教寺","author":"陈琏","text":"广陵城外寺，幽僻远尘氛。\n万竹秋含雨，高松暝宿云。\n跏趺僧入定，慷慨客论文。\n欲觅开山事，残碑半藓纹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49703,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望金山寺","author":"陈琏","text":"遥望金山寺，微茫水国中。\n江心开宝地，云气护龙宫。\n难辨天边树，遥闻月下钟。\n何时快登览，把酒酹坡翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49704,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发滁阳","author":"陈琏","text":"礼币承天宠，琴书促去程。\n此时离郡治，不日到都城。\n恋恋官僚意，依依父老情。\n两京叨校艺，别处值新正。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49705,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大店驿","author":"陈琏","text":"驿庭临古道，好似野人家。\n对雪频呼酒，敲冰旋煮茶。\n暖烟生榾柮，寒月映梅花。\n客况清如许，诗成祇自誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49706,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"通州","author":"陈琏","text":"河下舣兰舟，轻寒袭毳裘。\n远山和雪见，新水带冰流。\n商旅来何盛，人民住已稠。\n蓬莱行在望，五色卿云浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49707,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"考试毕同萧修撰时中陈编修仝宋检校宗杨教谕寿夫诸公登崇文阁","author":"陈琏","text":"杰阁淩霄汉，登临兴独长。\n楼台开罨画，形胜固金汤。\n水远通沧海，山高接太行。\n卿云浮凤阙，五色焕天章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49708,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过良乡","author":"陈琏","text":"昨日辞天阙，归途春又深。\n君亲俱在念，节序最关心。\n荒草青将遍，垂杨绿渐阴。\n西山犹在目，载酒忆登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49709,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逢新桥吕驿丞","author":"陈琏","text":"几度相逢处，情怀愈觉真。\n多因知己话，忽忆故乡人。\n满眼春光好，惊心节候新。\n题诗留别意，应记往来频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49710,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"界河驿涌翠轩","author":"陈琏","text":"此地经行惯，重来恰暮春。\n雨晴山涌翠，花落草成裀。\n林下麋呼子，阶前鹤迓人。\n小轩清可爱，独坐对湘筠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49711,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滕阳驿","author":"陈琏","text":"年来频给驿，公馆尽知名。\n喜与亲朋遇，无烦候吏迎。\n云山牵别思，风絮搅离情。\n况值春光暮，朝来始见莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49712,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邾城驿","author":"陈琏","text":"蒲酒邾城驿，频来似故居。\n尊馀黄米酒，馔有白鳞鱼。\n落日横孤嶂，轻烟淡远垆。\n客程将半月，几日到环滁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49713,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金山寺","author":"陈琏","text":"烟水混微茫，金山是上方。\n波心开佛刹，石罅隐禅房。\n风定垆烟直，江空磬韵长。\n妙高台上望，遥见五云乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49714,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"焦山寺","author":"陈琏","text":"江上焦山寺，匆匆未暇登。\n水环青一簇，树拥翠千层。\n两岸闻斋磬，中流见佛灯。\n昔人有遗迹，瘗鹤尚留铭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49715,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登东岳庙望茅山","author":"陈琏","text":"高楼俯廛市，此日快登临。\n幽静无尘气，清虚称道心。\n苔阶秋鹤舞，竹径晚蝉吟。\n怅望三茅境，白云深复深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49716,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和姚少师惠山泉亭上韵","author":"陈琏","text":"漪澜堂上坐，襟抱一时开。\n云自山腰起，泉从石罅来。\n金莲何代种，翠竹近年栽。\n好尽登临兴，茶杯胜酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49717,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"范文正公祠堂","author":"陈琏","text":"范公本人杰，百代有遗祠。\n科第成初志，功名际盛时。\n孤忠太史笔，纯孝义田碑。\n喜有诸孙在，春秋肃祭仪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49718,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承天寺","author":"陈琏","text":"承天吴首刹，结构素云奇。\n金碧辉晴昊，规模胜昔时。\n欲知南楚事，须读郑公碑。\n纵步修廊远，松阴日影移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49719,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登万佛阁","author":"陈琏","text":"杰阁淩霄汉，闲来喜一登。\n因将前代事，试问百年僧。\n树色青如染，山光翠作层。\n清心付寥廓，徙倚记吾曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49720,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游卧佛寺观东坡铜龟赞及黄文献公跋松雪道人画竹","author":"陈琏","text":"偶来游佛刹，政值早秋时。\n隔竹闻疏磬，荒苔翳旧碑。\n道人留古画，阁老有雄词。\n胜地空尘迹，悠然系所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49721,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观华严寺塔灯","author":"陈琏","text":"浮屠高突兀，阑槛倚云中。\n风铎几声响，花灯万点红。\n焰腾晴汉上，影落太湖中。\n入夜祥光动，犹疑降火龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49722,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试院夜坐偶成","author":"陈琏","text":"圣代崇科目，诸儒集棘闱。\n更深人语静，地迥漏声稀。\n光照青藜杖，凉生白纻衣。\n文章躬检阅，辞藻烂相辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49723,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试罢游云居庵奉和户部尚书夏公韵三首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"闲访招提境，满山都是云。\n泉声清可听，树色近难分。\n客至贪看竹，樵来或采薪。\n老僧年八十，终岁此安身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49724,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试罢游云居庵奉和户部尚书夏公韵三首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"一自中峰后，寥寥岁月遥。\n我来寻古迹，僧迓集诸僚。\n竹露寒苍玉，松风响翠涛。\n可人清净境，白日远尘嚣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49725,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试罢游云居庵奉和户部尚书夏公韵三首 其三","author":"陈琏","text":"闲来登宝刹，烟树望中微。\n岁月自今古，江山无是非。\n风声惊鹤梦，云气集僧衣。\n谁似禅栖者，安心久息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49726,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游云居寺在石经山二首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"我爱云居寺，闲来试一登。\n到门惟见鹤，入院少逢僧。\n触鼻闻薝卜，无心话葛藤。\n诗成题石壁，聊尔记吾曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49727,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游云居寺在石经山二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"我爱云居寺，山深客少来。\n古碑埋碧草，荒径长苍苔。\n香印烟初断，禅扉风自开。\n石经山色好，瞻眺意徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49728,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月初二发京师","author":"陈琏","text":"承恩升宪府，持节出神京。\n路向四川去，舟行几月程。\n君亲俱在念，弟妹政关情。\n早晚当趋蜀，知谁识使星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49729,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发张家湾","author":"陈琏","text":"初出蓬莱殿，遥临析水津。\n雪消山隐隐，冰泮水粼粼。\n报国心方切，观风志喜伸。\n咨询有封事，行拟达严宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49730,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登熙春岩庵","author":"陈琏","text":"我爱庵居好，登临兴独长。\n半岩花气重，一径竹阴凉。\n厨剩斋僧米，垆馀供佛香。\n自缘来往惯，常此乐徜徉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49731,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夷陵道中","author":"陈琏","text":"自入夷陵道，江山迥不同。\n长滩翻雪浪，两岸列云峰。\n客舫多从贾，人家少力农。\n莫言三峡远，南诏路皆通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49732,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平善埧阻水半月","author":"陈琏","text":"维舟平善埧，久滞雨纷纷。\n树色昏难辨，江声怒厌闻。\n家乡频入梦，亲友念离群。\n回首夷陵郡，青山隔暮云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49733,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过临清闻教谕徐孟恕已故诗以悼之","author":"陈琏","text":"有美西江彦，科名早出群。\n礼闱同校艺，芹泮共论文。\n死去嗟何及，讣来应忍闻。\n临清施教地，人独比河汾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49734,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过济宁逢蒋太守资","author":"陈琏","text":"我近官西蜀，君犹守济宁。\n重逢头总白，相见眼终青。\n政美非求异，心清爱独醒。\n明朝又分袂，离思满旗亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49735,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜新竹","author":"陈琏","text":"石犀多美竹，分种欲成阴。\n才见碧云影，如闻苍玉音。\n开窗宜静坐，凭几或长吟。\n劲节看看见，何妨霜雪侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49736,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居春怀","author":"陈琏","text":"帘幕昼常开，和风特地来。\n清严依柏府，崇峻近兰台。\n新竹鸣幽鸟，闲花点绿苔。\n公馀无一事，诗句颇能裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49737,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居秋怀","author":"陈琏","text":"退食无馀事，岙居事事幽。\n茶烹江水活，香爇篆烟浮。\n竹院秋声肃，松林雨气收。\n雪山高万仞，相对屋西头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49738,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江安孙县丞考满","author":"陈琏","text":"久佐江安邑，英英誉望隆。\n官闲勤看稿，公退或哦松。\n课政逾三考，稽勋觐九重。\n行看膺宠擢，鸾诰紫泥封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49739,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿真定南关教授张忱见访","author":"陈琏","text":"真定称名郡，孤城四面开。\n河从滹沱出，山自太行来。\n冬麦青连野，霜花白胜梅。\n偶逢张郡博，剪烛共衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49740,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简县道中","author":"陈琏","text":"简县行将近，遥看候吏迎。\n夕阳山外影，流水石边声。\n盐井勤收卤，农田不废耕。\n喜闻父老说，处处庆秋成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49741,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙泉驿","author":"陈琏","text":"解骖留古驿，喜值雨初晴。\n自念长途客，将逾万里程。\n云生塞子岭，树映锦官城。\n明日乌台去，无劳候吏迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49742,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄天观","author":"陈琏","text":"晓入琳宫去，逶迤路欲迷。\n苔阶行老鹤，花径卧驯麋。\n烟锁烧丹灶，春生种药蹊。\n白头陈道士，此处乐幽栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49743,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石首县","author":"陈琏","text":"廛市临江澨，涛声白昼寒。\n丹青卫公庙，紫翠锦林山。\n芹泮儒风盛，花封化日闲。\n偶逢陈大尹，能慰客怀宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49744,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过大鎗岭","author":"陈琏","text":"残夏暑方炽，趋程日未曛。\n龙分隔山雨，风送过溪云。\n鹿迹寻常见，蝉声续断闻。\n池河行在望，烟树绿纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49745,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过枫子岭","author":"陈琏","text":"晓登枫子岭，日色正曈昽。\n路近将临巩，山高远接嵩。\n鸟飞青嶂外，人语白云中。\n回首蓬莱近，丹心恋九重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49746,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西岳庙二首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"大舜西巡后，兹山天下闻。\n门高森画戟，碑古失遗文。\n松桂垂青雨，峰峦隐白云。\n春秋严祀典，应荷圣明君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49747,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西岳庙二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"閒游西岳庙，太华入遐观。\n石印仙人掌，峰如司寇冠。\n松风侵座响，桂雨到窗寒。\n瞻望情无极，何时再倚阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49748,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大王川","author":"陈琏","text":"自入大王川，襟怀忽洒然。\n石边多废宅，山上尽闲田。\n淡淡岚光薄，萋萋草色鲜。\n自从兵革后，林下少人烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49749,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王家庄","author":"陈琏","text":"山后人烟少，王家幸有庄。\n丁男频守戍，妇女废蚕桑。\n树色千章秀，溪声一派长。\n自从兵燹后，风物转凄凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49750,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西川驿五日","author":"陈琏","text":"云川逢五日，旅况觉无聊。\n日午忘挥扇，风寒便拥貂。\n綵丝谁系臂，白羽自随腰。\n马奶浑如酒，倾来慰寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49751,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安岭","author":"陈琏","text":"晓到长安岭，关城近碧峰。\n已看红日上，犹见白云封。\n戍卒虽严守，行人竟少逢。\n怀来欣在望，烟树翠重重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49752,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观演武","author":"陈琏","text":"白面羽林郎，陈兵出教场。\n阵分鱼丽市，旗列火云张。\n岂独军容盛，咸誇武伎良。\n射雕多中镝，走马不持缰。\n剑买千金值，弓弯一石强。\n矢心探虎穴，受命属龙骧。\n仁贵功期并，云长勇可方。\n此行听奏捷，竹帛永流芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49753,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"驾至忽秃山","author":"陈琏","text":"自别开平后，沙场路几程。\n赐归承宠诏，逐队出长城。\n汹汹人争去，萧萧马自鸣。\n翠华看渐远，回首独凝情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49754,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题焦氏林塘读书图","author":"陈琏","text":"闻道林塘景，萧然远世情。\n苔阶多鹤迹，茅屋有书声。\n曾著潜夫论，因传处士名。\n空馀图画在，翰墨尚留馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49755,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠济宁刘州判观德","author":"陈琏","text":"济宁刘节判，邂逅意何多。\n共说乡枌话，胜如雪夜过。\n银丝脍锦鲤，绿酒酌红螺。\n别后期珍重，功名鬓未皤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49756,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平望驿遇陈华驿宰","author":"陈琏","text":"古驿临堤上，平田入望中。\n声寒芦叶雨，香淡藕花风。\n处处人家好，村村水路通。\n白头陈驿宰，邂逅喜相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49757,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桂轩为王志□赋","author":"陈琏","text":"桂树当轩好，萧然远市嚣。\n虬枝凝宿露，蝉魄转良宵。\n翠叶团团密，清香阵阵□。\n□□堪佚老，不用小山招。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49758,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次参","author":"陈琏","text":"才略迥超群，□□□□□。\n□□□□作，诗好播清芬。\n蚤著为藩绩，今收督漕□。\n□□□□□，□□□□纷。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":49759,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]